later steps (6, 7, 9)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="104" y="955" width="200" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v85" value="&lt;b&gt;Numbered flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 merge feature/* into develop&lt;br&gt;2 webhook via CodeConnections starts the pipeline&lt;br&gt;3 build + test (CodeBuild, test stage in Docker)&lt;br&gt;4 push image to ECR (immutable tag = short SHA)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="892" width="330" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v86" value="&lt;br&gt;5 deploy to ECS dev (rolling, circuit breaker rollback)&lt;br&gt;6 smoke test through the ALB (version == IMAGE_TAG)&lt;br&gt;7 record released tag in SSM parameter" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="690" y="892" width="330" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v87" value="&lt;b&gt;Build once, deploy many&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The image is built and tested once; every deploy references the same immutable tag.&lt;br&gt;Terraform envs/dev reads the released tag from SSM, so an infra apply keeps the image the pipeline last deployed." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="892" width="820" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
